{"event_type":"review","id":"c0b8ee249ffcb24f57770b7c87f3b72262f74180bd7d1feaa263a7e9a99a2623","occurred_at":"2026-11-16T00:31:12Z","payload":{"artifacts":[{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/0c914a86299aab4f96cd8bcb409cd724678b33281a30ad1dbf654ac0aff89f13","sha256":"0c914a86299aab4f96cd8bcb409cd724678b33281a30ad1dbf654ac0aff89f13"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/14ee3f1fea9b6ea3fabb89d00f13762e25113a52340b66603128085d3ca895bc","sha256":"14ee3f1fea9b6ea3fabb89d00f13762e25113a52340b66603128085d3ca895bc"},{"kind":"git-bundle","location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/f65437f8817497dc920984df5944c2eccc406a21ba8d9a6e360dde22ca207209","sha256":"f65437f8817497dc920984df5944c2eccc406a21ba8d9a6e360dde22ca207209"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/548164cf91669c52ca5422ecbdbe314305c100e7ca9a9d21e1b9d4d69f2762ba","sha256":"548164cf91669c52ca5422ecbdbe314305c100e7ca9a9d21e1b9d4d69f2762ba"},{"location":"/home/ctaylor/.local/share/crq-backfill/artifacts/sha256/a577df0f14d12c1adb44ca079de979e6c8410d83202a3d319f6edd102f28fcae","sha256":"a577df0f14d12c1adb44ca079de979e6c8410d83202a3d319f6edd102f28fcae"}],"attempt_id":"e22bc502d4fd8a48746408f6f75858d3502164a672aac58ddf01f517a295c47f:0:1","base":"3db35d152100d55f0ef1b79a8c605bf4a9ce13b5","completion":{"errors":[],"exit_code":0,"scope_verified":true,"skipped":false,"terminal":true},"findings":[{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"7928a2b9606d30706fbcb1abd82f8e8590bc9178","body":"**Do not treat leader closure as process-group termination.**\n\nIf a descendant ignores SIGTERM and redirects its stdio, the leader can close while that descendant remains alive. Node's `close` event covers the leader and its streams, not all process-group members. ([nodejs.org](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest-v22.x/api/child_process.html))\n\nIn `src/shared/proc.ts:720–721`, this returns before group SIGKILL. Line 553 also removes the child from `activeChildren` during ordinary per-run cancellation, so the exit backstop cannot clean up the surviving descendant.\n\nTrack process-group cleanup separately from leader closure. Retain ownership until the group is gone or the final termination attempt completes.","id":"d24b11ce110be550cf5c42051cda9c5cb401822f71d26e0e2bf01a7477884fac","intervals":[[720,721]],"path":"src/shared/proc.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Do not treat leader closure as process-group termination."},{"anchor_status":"verified","blob":"7928a2b9606d30706fbcb1abd82f8e8590bc9178","body":"**Apply environment precedence case-insensitively on Windows.**\n\nIn `src/shared/proc.ts:265`, an override `{ Path: replacement }` leaves the inherited `PATH` entry unchanged. The allowlist creates both spellings. Node selects `PATH` first, so the child receives the inherited executable search path instead of the override. Removing only `PATH` also leaves `Path`. ([nodejs.org](https://nodejs.org/docs/latest-v22.x/api/child_process.html))\n\nNormalize equivalent names on Windows before applying overrides and removals. Preserve case-sensitive names on POSIX.","id":"f39d12a125cc7be8972fe98540c1b6a26cb17d04eff8448c696a96cf687d36e3","intervals":[[265,265]],"path":"src/shared/proc.ts","severity":"major","source_id":null,"status":"untriaged","title":"Apply environment precedence case-insensitively on Windows."}],"head":"933d959ada14189a270972478bd9b6268399b39e","head_tree":"40cca612920bd0f60b7d7ded61025db433bf3a2a","input_scope":[{"blob":"7928a2b9606d30706fbcb1abd82f8e8590bc9178","intervals":[[1,746]],"path":"src/shared/proc.ts"}],"job_id":"e22bc502d4fd8a48746408f6f75858d3502164a672aac58ddf01f517a295c47f:0","outcome":"completed","paths":[{"baseline":{"method":"projection","reason":"path cluster"},"blob":"7928a2b9606d30706fbcb1abd82f8e8590bc9178","disposition":"included","mode":"100644","path":"src/shared/proc.ts","reason":"bounded verified input"}],"policy_digest":"eacd1bcf42a0e72eca72fcf9c1e9c8f97e7c515cd67a8fa7965c966924647693","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","requested_scope":[{"blob":"7928a2b9606d30706fbcb1abd82f8e8590bc9178","intervals":[[375,376],[397,413],[450,450],[474,474],[486,488],[559,561],[570,570],[582,582]],"path":"src/shared/proc.ts"}],"reviewed_scope":[{"blob":"7928a2b9606d30706fbcb1abd82f8e8590bc9178","intervals":[[375,376],[397,413],[450,450],[474,474],[486,488],[559,561],[570,570],[582,582]],"path":"src/shared/proc.ts"}],"scope_digest":"57f218a704969fb071daa53124063fa29706eb98e375b5749084436ec32123e7","source":{"authenticated":true,"id":"backfill-e22bc502d4fd8a48746408f6f75858d3502164a672aac58ddf01f517a295c47f-g0-20261116T002707Z","producer":"crq-runner-app","repo":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit","type":"crq-run"},"subject_id":"e22bc502d4fd8a48746408f6f75858d3502164a672aac58ddf01f517a295c47f","target":"b7a9d30e6da70bc6b5ba6f43874fb7595c4465ec","target_tree":"40cca612920bd0f60b7d7ded61025db433bf3a2a"},"schema":"cq.review-ledger/v1","source_key":"camerontaylor/cq-toolkit:crq-runner-app:backfill-e22bc502d4fd8a48746408f6f75858d3502164a672aac58ddf01f517a295c47f-g0-20261116T002707Z"}